(label "BIAS_ERR" (at 650.24 226.06 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2f591525-a6ee-4f96-8fda-af0bcff56b48))
(label "ERR_HP" (at 679.45 226.06 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c199484-a770-466a-ba46-b256594b647a))
(label "VAR_BIAS_CMD" (at 703.58 248.92 270) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 39510435-7af5-4f98-83c9-f63f9a70c185))
(label "VAR_BIAS_DRIVE" (at 711.20 231.14 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ba312f13-c041-40c2-9069-e605d2d8815b))
(text "1  INPUT" (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3f49e183-53d2-45d0-a008-ab4572a0d460))
(text "phase splitter: IN_HALF_NEG = -x/2, IN_HALF_POS = +x/2" (at 20.32 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 19664a58-163e-405d-861b-7d38336da8bf))
(text "3  MODULATOR" (at 139.70 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 61c1a15f-9047-48ab-b2b2-bcd94928c783))
(text "DG419 choppers at the carrier" (at 139.70 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid faa95829-0edb-46e2-8cf8-eadbfd450c90))
(text "U7 -> fixed capacitor,  U8 -> varactor pair (opposite phase)" (at 139.70 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dc2e7f3c-e4a3-4a71-8111-d00fc35fabbd))
(text "4  HALF-BRIDGE + CHARGE AMP" (at 208.28 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 71c7134d-70f2-4c35-9b5b-bd04e90ed2d7))
(text "CHG_AMP_SUM and VAR_BIAS_NODE are high-impedance: PTFE standoffs, no breadboard" (at 208.28 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8ad0ecbd-5bae-45ad-8e72-d9dd0dc19ddf))
(text "Gain = (C_pair - C_fixed) / (2 Cf).  CT3 sets the null near VB = 12 V.  CT1/CT2 optional pair-match trim." (at 208.28 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c53b76b5-59b2-4065-a052-b66cfaaa84aa))
(text "5  DEMOD, HOLD, FILTER, OUTPUT" (at 340.36 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 833d2c47-19ea-4051-b5f8-8a2493461e54))
(text "sync demod + gated hold + 30 kHz 4th-order Butterworth + makeup gain" (at 340.36 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b842e484-0e62-4dd3-b342-d931a6f4a3be))
(text "2  TIMING" (at 20.32 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5157f63e-b73e-47e4-b3a4-2b77b680b4db))
(text "3.2768 MHz / 32 = 102.4 kHz carrier; HOLD_GATE high for counts 8..14 of each half-period" (at 20.32 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f2de902a-5afd-4e22-b9f6-ba7707858ae4))
(text "JP3: choose the position where TP6 (HOLD_CAP) is a clean staircase with no spikes at carrier edges" (at 20.32 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 317f92d4-148b-478c-9721-7af8c6e19431))
(text "6  CONTROL" (at 279.40 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 40311588-12a2-4ad2-8ecb-9de28a4333b1))
(text "VAR_BIAS_CMD = 2 x GAIN_CV + 2 x VB_OFFSET  (VB_OFFSET ~0.75 V: 1.5..11.5 V for GAIN_CV 0..5 V)" (at 279.40 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 18598269-06a1-41b5-849b-92ca25f62a3e))
(text "RV3: set VAR_BIAS_CMD = 1.5 V with GAIN_CV = 0.  JP1 selects external CV (J4) or the manual pot RV2." (at 279.40 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 86c5894a-ef6b-4f1b-bc3d-22ac997862f4))
(text "9  BIAS SERVO" (at 533.40 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c21d6fd1-19ee-4cc0-b321-516da45e6d98))
(text "bootstrapped feed: VAR_BIAS_DRIVE = VAR_BIAS_CMD + 0.99 x HP1Hz(BIAS_SENSE - REP_SENSE)" (at 533.40 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4d4075c3-9a93-4dae-9375-45178131af24))
(text "D3, D4 = MMBV2109LT1G" (at 566.42 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 87bf20f5-391d-462e-9336-a61a2ad15810))
(text "Guard ring around VAR_BIAS_NODE (D1/D2 cathodes, RB1, U16A pin 3) driven by BIAS_SENSE.  Replica D3/D4: matched to D1/D2 within 0.2 %, same thermal block." (at 533.40 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0ae53bb6-3736-42fd-b6ec-e430bed3cde6))
(text "Trim RV5: no audio, CV = 0.5 Hz square (small steps). Adjust RV5 until TP11 (BIAS_ERR) shows no step-shaped transients." (at 533.40 275.59 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3cfcc9c0-4220-4cb9-8130-fd9fa7953b90))
(text "U17/U18: INA128 at G = 1 (RG open). U18 REF carries VAR_BIAS_CMD with unity gain to the drive - this exactness is what keeps gain moves clean." (at 533.40 281.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e336a4a7-ed7c-4609-ab0e-4e2ae2fb6ed5))
(text "7  POWER" (at 20.32 317.50 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3df8c860-b11d-4da0-9726-53435d2b3147))
(text "+/-15 V in, 78L05 for logic and DG419 VL" (at 20.32 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4ca74fa4-3523-45bd-9def-461ab7d48e8e))
(text "8  IC SUPPLY PINS + DECOUPLING" (at 152.40 317.50 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5582c42c-6972-4c40-b0ad-f0cf15e2f78c))
(text "one 100n per supply pin, placed right at the IC" (at 152.40 322.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 84eb4a52-5a7a-4866-bd86-79db88bd38e4))
(text "C1,C2: U1   C12,C13: U2   C18-C21: U9,U10   C22-C25: U3,U4   C30,C31: U5   C6-C9: U7,U8   C10,C11,C26,C27: DG419 VL   C3-C5: X1, U11, U12   C42,C43: U16   C44,C45: U17   C46,C47: U18" (at 152.40 477.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 367974d9-31d9-42bb-a443-470c578ca639))
(text "VARACTOR HALF-BRIDGE GAIN CELL  -  prototype v2 (single varactor pair).  Unverified design: build & measure." (at 20.32 497.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b53de010-1cad-4751-8f47-d979cd279268))
(text "Signal path (top row, left to right): input splitter -> chopper -> varactor half-bridge -> charge amp -> sync demod -> hold -> 30 kHz LPF -> makeup gain." (at 20.32 505.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 64290ced-86e7-4185-9cf6-4a7053662b27))
(text "Bring-up: 1) TP1 = 102.4 kHz, TP2 high for counts 8..14;  2) JP3 so TP6 is flat at carrier edges;  3) RV3 for 1.5 V at TP9 with GAIN_CV = 0;" (at 20.32 513.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b4e6f7af-b7f7-435d-99e1-d90ab9b1d154))
(text "4) GAIN_CV = 5 V, adjust CT3 for about 25 dB below the GAIN_CV = 0 level;  5) optional CT1/CT2 for minimum THD." (at 20.32 520.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 68f0f813-615f-426e-b399-4d64be543a71))
(text "Bias: RB1 3.3M fed from VAR_BIAS_DRIVE (block 9 bootstrap): ~0.8 ms gain response, sim. THD 0.03-0.04 % 50 Hz-1 kHz at +8 dBu." (at 20.32 528.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d26b609e-7dfa-41ce-96a4-6838f80eab01))
(text "D1, D2: onsemi MMBV2109LT1G (SOT-23, 33 pF @ 4 V) or LV2209 (TO-92, same specs; footprint varactor:Varactor_TO-92-2_A1-K2). Match <1 %, thermally coupled." (at 20.32 535.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2da8752a-30e0-471b-8da4-d0160cb44a40))
